WEBVTT

01:30.440 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:36.880 --> 01:39.000
Let him go.
I'll return to the Dark Abyss with you.

01:39.600 --> 01:41.160
After staying
in the human realm for so long,

01:41.240 --> 01:42.800
you haven't learned much,

01:42.880 --> 01:44.880
but you've become more useless.

01:44.960 --> 01:48.000
He's not part of the Immortal Alliance.
He's no threat to you.

01:49.040 --> 01:50.120
Don't kill him.

01:56.440 --> 01:57.680
Fine.

01:58.520 --> 02:01.760
There's really no need
to damage the bond between us

02:01.840 --> 02:04.640
as master and disciple
for someone irrelevant.

02:12.240 --> 02:15.120
I despise nothing more
than people scheming behind my back.

02:15.200 --> 02:17.880
Master, don't kill him! I'm begging you!

02:17.960 --> 02:21.280
Trying to call for reinforcements, huh?
I can help you with that.

02:26.680 --> 02:27.520
It's Sang Qi.

02:32.520 --> 02:34.000
What exactly are you planning?

02:36.160 --> 02:38.560
Don't worry. You'll find out soon enough.

02:45.400 --> 02:46.400
Mu Xuanling…

02:53.280 --> 02:54.120
Sir!

02:55.480 --> 02:57.600
Mr. Xie, is Sang Qi attacking?

02:59.320 --> 03:00.760
You're just in time.

03:00.840 --> 03:01.680
Sang Qi is launching a night attack.

03:01.760 --> 03:03.240
We must not let him enter
the city and cause harm.

03:03.320 --> 03:04.160
I'll take him on.

03:04.240 --> 03:06.800
The Pearl Tower is in your capable hands.

03:07.400 --> 03:08.840
Be careful.

03:14.040 --> 03:16.000
Why hasn't Su Ningzhen arrived?

03:16.080 --> 03:18.560
Forget about her for now.
Protecting the Pearl Tower comes first.

03:24.520 --> 03:25.560
What exactly are you trying to do?

03:39.160 --> 03:42.160
Xie Xuechen, we meet again.

03:49.880 --> 03:51.520
Why have you intruded
into the Snow City at night?

03:51.600 --> 03:53.080
What business do you have?

03:59.040 --> 04:01.800
Naturally,
I'm here to bring my disciple back.

04:03.600 --> 04:05.560
Then, I can't let you have your way.

04:06.080 --> 04:08.400
Mu Xuanling belongs to Snow City now.

04:09.920 --> 04:11.640
If you want her to change loyalties,

04:12.400 --> 04:13.720
I won't agree to it.

04:45.240 --> 04:46.440
Mr. Xie,

04:46.960 --> 04:50.440
I put a lot of effort
into setting up this killing array.

04:51.040 --> 04:54.040
Now, do you want a duel
to the death with me,

04:54.920 --> 04:58.800
or will you save those suffering humans?

05:26.040 --> 05:26.880
Mu Xuanling…

05:31.920 --> 05:33.200
Wait for me!

05:38.840 --> 05:41.320
You saw it. He left.

05:42.480 --> 05:45.560
For his human world, he abandoned you.

05:47.880 --> 05:51.840
Is this the love you're willing
to sacrifice your life for?

05:54.240 --> 05:55.280
It's not worth it.

05:58.720 --> 05:59.920
You don't understand me,

06:02.000 --> 06:03.360
and you understand him even less.

06:09.520 --> 06:12.760
I don't need to understand someone
who's about to die.

06:16.200 --> 06:19.560
He took the explosion
of Fajian's golden essence head-on alone.

06:19.640 --> 06:21.160
Even if he hides it well,

06:21.240 --> 06:24.520
it won't change the fact
that he's injured.

06:25.680 --> 06:29.520
If Xie Xuechen wants to win,
he can only fight desperately.

06:32.800 --> 06:33.840
Xie Xuechen…

06:44.040 --> 06:46.080
Sang Qi's power is truly overwhelming!

06:46.160 --> 06:48.960
If this demonic energy killing array
covers the Snow City,

06:49.520 --> 06:51.200
the entire place will be destroyed.

06:51.280 --> 06:52.840
Can Mr. Xie hold out?

07:20.400 --> 07:22.600
Whether he can hold out, I don't know,

07:22.680 --> 07:25.800
but you all… definitely cannot.

07:26.600 --> 07:27.600
Who are you?

07:28.920 --> 07:30.280
The one here for the Pearl.

07:40.920 --> 07:42.120
Mr. Xie,

07:42.920 --> 07:44.640
you want to keep her so badly.

07:45.440 --> 07:48.000
Have you fallen for her?

07:49.960 --> 07:51.520
But you probably don't know.

07:51.600 --> 07:56.200
Ling approached you with hidden motives
from the very beginning.

07:57.880 --> 08:00.880
People always say
the Dark Clan is inherently cruel,

08:01.640 --> 08:03.360
and the Spirit Clan is deceptive.

08:03.960 --> 08:06.640
Actually, there's some truth to it.

08:06.720 --> 08:09.200
I'm sure Ling never told you

08:09.280 --> 08:11.920
that back then, it was with my permission

08:12.520 --> 08:14.520
that she rescued you from the Lava.

08:16.640 --> 08:17.840
You don't believe me?

08:18.640 --> 08:22.120
I gave her the Half-Day Glory pill
you took that day.

08:22.760 --> 08:25.680
There's only one in existence.

08:46.800 --> 08:49.280
What could the Lava do to him?

08:51.560 --> 08:53.240
Keeping him there is useless.

08:54.040 --> 08:57.040
Master, why not try my method?

08:58.960 --> 09:00.160
Let's hear it.

09:00.240 --> 09:03.360
Save him, stay with him, get close to him,

09:03.960 --> 09:05.360
trick him into letting down his guard,

09:06.320 --> 09:10.720
then seize the Chaos Pearl
and destroy the Immortal Alliance.

09:12.160 --> 09:14.200
Here is the Half-Day Glory. Take it.

09:14.280 --> 09:16.600
For Xie Xuechen's life,

09:16.680 --> 09:19.000
are you even throwing yours away?

09:19.080 --> 09:20.480
How could I?

09:20.560 --> 09:22.720
The Spirit Clan
lives for a thousand years.

09:22.800 --> 09:25.400
The world is vast, and men are plentiful.

09:25.480 --> 09:28.520
Why would I die
for someone like Xie Xuechen?

09:29.080 --> 09:31.360
I'm just toying with him.

09:31.440 --> 09:34.360
Rest assured, Master.
I will complete the mission,

09:34.440 --> 09:37.680
retrieve the Chaos Pearl,
and kill Xie Xuechen.

09:58.400 --> 10:00.920
If this fight continues, you'll die.

10:41.920 --> 10:43.120
I'll bear the fault

10:44.360 --> 10:45.680
of my sect!

10:56.760 --> 10:59.800
Don't try so hard.
It will spare you some pain.

11:30.880 --> 11:32.000
Xie Xuechen!

11:35.320 --> 11:37.040
The Xie family of the Snow City

11:37.640 --> 11:40.760
all share a stubborn flaw.

11:42.120 --> 11:43.840
But in my eyes,

11:43.920 --> 11:46.640
it's just inherited arrogance.

11:50.080 --> 11:51.560
He won't lose!

12:01.920 --> 12:02.800
Ling,

12:04.160 --> 12:05.120
it's time for us to go.

12:31.360 --> 12:34.720
Mr. Xie,
it seems you've paid quite a price.

12:35.240 --> 12:36.560
Xie Xuechen…

12:45.160 --> 12:46.840
I won't believe what he says.

12:47.720 --> 12:50.200
Love truly leads to ruin.

12:51.040 --> 12:54.000
Even Mr. Xie is trapped in it.

12:54.080 --> 12:56.400
You know full well
the recording stone doesn't lie,

12:56.480 --> 12:59.360
yet here you are, deceiving yourself.

13:56.200 --> 13:58.520
Xie Xuechen! Xie Xuechen!

14:33.600 --> 14:36.440
Mr. Xie, do you still want to fight?

14:37.080 --> 14:38.600
Your injuries are severe.

14:38.680 --> 14:40.840
If you keep fighting, you will really die.

14:47.480 --> 14:51.000
All because of Ling,
you want a duel to the death with me?

14:52.240 --> 14:53.080
Is it worth it?

14:54.280 --> 14:57.840
Mu Xuanling's demonic power is gone.
She has no ties to the Dark Abyss anymore.

15:00.520 --> 15:02.080
She is now a disciple of the Snow City.

16:47.480 --> 16:49.280
Enough, Xie Xuechen.

16:55.960 --> 16:58.160
Enough! Xie Xuechen,

16:58.240 --> 16:59.760
stop coming closer!

17:19.160 --> 17:21.720
Xie Xuechen, Enough!

17:47.920 --> 17:51.000
I said enough. Don't you understand?

17:52.600 --> 17:55.440
Master has already told you the truth.
What's wrong?

17:56.200 --> 17:57.520
You don't want to believe it?

17:58.640 --> 17:59.800
Let me tell you the truth.

18:00.560 --> 18:02.880
This act of liking you
has gone on long enough.

18:03.600 --> 18:04.760
I'm already sick of it.

18:04.840 --> 18:07.200
I am the proud Saintess of the Dark Abyss.

18:07.280 --> 18:09.720
What makes you think
I'd willingly stay in the Snow City

18:10.320 --> 18:13.520
as a lowly cleaning disciple,
at your beck and call?

18:14.560 --> 18:15.760
No…

18:18.920 --> 18:20.480
These are not true words from your heart.

18:22.880 --> 18:24.520
Xie Xuechen,

18:25.720 --> 18:27.280
you're so full of yourself.

18:28.160 --> 18:30.840
You were nothing more to me
than a substitute for my Mister,

18:31.520 --> 18:32.720
just a toy.

18:33.960 --> 18:36.440
I only wanted to see
what the Chosen of Heaven

18:36.520 --> 18:38.200
would look like caught in a web of love.

18:38.720 --> 18:42.200
And now that I see it,
it's honestly quite dull.

18:42.800 --> 18:46.320
Just like any ordinary person,
trapped by love,

18:47.200 --> 18:48.200
unable to let go.

19:02.640 --> 19:04.520
You're gravely injured.

19:05.120 --> 19:08.600
How could you possibly be a match
for Master and me?

19:13.040 --> 19:15.560
Xie Xuechen, not killing you

19:16.480 --> 19:18.960
is only because you saved my life.

19:20.240 --> 19:22.240
Stop deceiving yourself
and ruining my plans.

19:22.320 --> 19:23.560
Otherwise,

19:24.800 --> 19:26.400
I really will kill you.

19:31.520 --> 19:34.440
Ling, it's time to go back.

20:01.120 --> 20:02.640
I've waited for you for 10,000 years…

20:17.680 --> 20:19.040
The Chaos Pearl!

20:33.920 --> 20:35.160
Ridiculous!

20:48.480 --> 20:52.480
Mr. Xie, you've arrived quite quickly.

21:11.480 --> 21:12.720
You didn't kill them.

21:13.720 --> 21:16.760
Hand over the Chaos Pearl,
and I'll spare your life.

21:19.040 --> 21:21.480
Mr. Xie, do you really think
you can command me?

21:22.960 --> 21:25.320
You endured the golden essence explosion

21:25.400 --> 21:26.800
and Sang Qi's blows.

21:27.600 --> 21:30.600
How much spiritual power do you have left?

21:31.200 --> 21:32.160
However much remains…

21:34.040 --> 21:36.320
I face death, but I do not retreat!

21:40.760 --> 21:42.720
For what you wish to protect,

21:43.440 --> 21:45.480
you've always given your all.

21:47.120 --> 21:49.560
But if you realized
that what you're protecting is a joke,

21:50.200 --> 21:52.080
I wonder how you'd feel.

21:53.280 --> 21:55.120
The Chaos Pearl
is still in the Pearl Tower.

21:56.080 --> 21:59.640
But when you see it,
you might be disappointed.

22:38.440 --> 22:39.400
No way…

22:41.280 --> 22:45.560
Even if an ancient artifact perishes,
it can never shatter.

22:46.160 --> 22:47.440
Could it be fake?

22:48.080 --> 22:51.400
For what you wish to protect,
you've always given your all.

22:52.800 --> 22:55.200
But if you realized
that what you're protecting is a joke,

22:55.280 --> 22:57.200
I wonder how you'd feel.

23:24.120 --> 23:26.640
The Chaos Pearl has been
heavily guarded by the Immortal Alliance.

23:26.720 --> 23:28.560
How could it be fake?

23:29.080 --> 23:31.480
Could it be you made a mistake?

23:35.240 --> 23:39.040
I'm also curious
who could the masterful one be,

23:39.920 --> 23:41.480
using a fake pearl

23:42.000 --> 23:44.240
to fool the entire Immortal Alliance
for so long?

23:46.320 --> 23:47.840
I misspoke earlier.

23:47.920 --> 23:50.120
I shouldn't have doubted you, Master.

23:50.880 --> 23:51.800
No harm done.

23:55.520 --> 23:59.040
The act is over now.
It's time to remove the disguise.

24:24.200 --> 24:27.640
Master, your disguise techniques
are truly brilliant.

24:28.800 --> 24:29.800
However,

24:31.040 --> 24:32.600
this is my first time impersonating you.

24:32.680 --> 24:33.640
Though I tried my best to mimic you,

24:33.720 --> 24:35.160
I still worry someone
might uncover the tricks.

24:35.800 --> 24:37.320
You've followed me for many years

24:38.080 --> 24:40.240
and have always been
my most trusted agent.

24:41.120 --> 24:42.600
When facing Sang Qi
and Xie Xuechen earlier,

24:42.680 --> 24:44.320
you showed no fear.

24:44.840 --> 24:46.680
Why, then, are you worried tonight?

24:47.280 --> 24:49.000
Because tonight should've been the night
our plan succeeded.

24:49.080 --> 24:49.960
No mistakes were allowed.

24:50.840 --> 24:52.200
But unexpectedly,

24:52.280 --> 24:55.920
the greatest mistake
turned out to be the Chaos Pearl itself.

24:56.440 --> 24:58.400
Our grand cause isn't urgent.

24:58.480 --> 25:01.280
As long as the Chaos Pearl
still exists in this world,

25:01.360 --> 25:02.920
hope remains unbroken.

25:03.640 --> 25:04.880
One day,

25:04.960 --> 25:07.680
I'll make the world
you yearn for a reality.

25:08.960 --> 25:11.800
Having you impersonate me tonight
was merely to prove my presence.

25:11.880 --> 25:15.360
In the future, unless necessary,
I won't ask you to do it again.

25:17.960 --> 25:18.880
Return now.

25:19.600 --> 25:21.240
The longer you stay,
the more suspicious they'll become.

25:22.000 --> 25:24.560
Let those in the Immortal Alliance
help us figure out

25:25.080 --> 25:26.640
where exactly the Chaos Pearl is.

25:36.760 --> 25:38.680
I've already returned with you.
What more do you want?

25:38.760 --> 25:42.440
If you truly wish to come back,
I would naturally be delighted.

25:43.120 --> 25:45.880
But you did it for Xie Xuechen!

25:47.160 --> 25:48.680
Did you think I wouldn't notice?

25:49.360 --> 25:51.440
You said to him those harsh words

25:51.520 --> 25:54.880
just because you were worried
I'd take his life.

25:58.440 --> 26:00.640
Since you know this, why not just kill me?

26:03.240 --> 26:07.160
Xie Xuechen struggled
so hard to save your life,

26:07.240 --> 26:08.640
and now you're so ready to throw it away?

26:12.520 --> 26:13.800
Let me tell you,

26:14.880 --> 26:16.800
he expelled your demonic power

26:17.480 --> 26:20.080
but passed on
the Jade Vault Technique to you.

26:21.440 --> 26:25.120
He's treated you so extraordinarily well.

26:35.400 --> 26:38.040
The Jade Vault Technique
is truly profound.

26:38.600 --> 26:42.920
I always wondered
how could his power grow stronger

26:43.000 --> 26:45.800
even after his spiritual channels
were destroyed seven years ago?

26:47.560 --> 26:50.840
It turns out the Jade Vault Technique
can truly rebuild spiritual channels.

26:51.440 --> 26:53.520
He passed the Jade Vault Technique to me?

26:55.520 --> 26:56.400
No wonder…

26:57.400 --> 27:00.000
I have been recovering day by day,

27:00.080 --> 27:01.360
and I'm no longer afraid
of the burning sun.

27:01.960 --> 27:03.840
But why didn't I know this myself?

27:04.920 --> 27:06.360
He passed the Jade Vault Technique to you,

27:07.840 --> 27:09.480
and now you possess spiritual channels.

27:10.360 --> 27:13.120
With the Immortal Alliance's
Spiritual Forms gathered in the Snow City,

27:14.480 --> 27:16.120
if they discover this,

27:16.200 --> 27:19.040
the Alliance members
will surely put you to death.

27:20.480 --> 27:22.320
He thought he could deceive everyone,

27:23.320 --> 27:24.840
but he couldn't fool me.

27:25.680 --> 27:26.560
How do you know this?

27:27.560 --> 27:30.960
Xie Xuechen can block

27:31.040 --> 27:33.080
Heartstring's control over you,

27:33.160 --> 27:36.880
but he cannot block
Heartstring's perception of you.

27:36.960 --> 27:40.160
No matter where you are,
I can always find your location,

27:40.800 --> 27:43.640
and I can understand
your physical condition.

27:44.360 --> 27:46.800
So, when your demonic power was expelled
and your spiritual channels were unlocked,

27:47.560 --> 27:49.960
I knew it even better than you did.

27:51.000 --> 27:52.760
So, everything you've done

27:53.640 --> 27:56.120
isn't just to obtain the Chaos Pearl
and break the Immortals Array.

27:56.920 --> 27:58.160
It's also for the Jade Vault Technique.

27:58.240 --> 28:00.200
I have to do this!

28:02.960 --> 28:06.720
Cultivating demonic power
can make me stronger,

28:07.240 --> 28:08.960
but it's far from enough.

28:10.080 --> 28:12.040
If I can unlock spiritual channels,

28:12.560 --> 28:14.960
I will break through
the limits of Spirit Clan cultivation.

28:16.360 --> 28:20.120
From then on, I'll fear no one.

28:26.840 --> 28:27.760
What is this?

28:29.560 --> 28:31.720
It's a medicine to ease your pain.

28:33.360 --> 28:34.760
It's called the Disillusion Water.

28:35.400 --> 28:38.040
Take it, and you'll break all emotions,

28:39.080 --> 28:40.320
forgetting both love and hate.

28:42.600 --> 28:43.880
You may still remember

28:43.960 --> 28:46.920
the people you've met
and the experiences you've had,

28:47.000 --> 28:48.440
but recalling them

28:49.000 --> 28:51.960
will no longer stir your heart.

28:53.640 --> 28:56.680
All your love stems from Xie Xuechen,

28:56.760 --> 29:00.040
and your hatred toward me
is also because of him.

29:00.840 --> 29:04.280
Once you forget your love for him,
you'll also forget your hatred toward me.

29:04.360 --> 29:08.480
You'll only remember
that you approached him on my orders

29:08.560 --> 29:09.960
to seize the Chaos Pearl.

29:10.560 --> 29:12.040
Everything you've said to him

29:12.120 --> 29:14.680
and everything you've done
were just tactics.

29:14.760 --> 29:16.760
All of it was false.

29:17.400 --> 29:18.480
From now on,

29:18.560 --> 29:22.040
the barriers between us
will no longer exist.

29:22.120 --> 29:23.720
Only then

29:24.400 --> 29:27.720
will I spare your life.

29:30.880 --> 29:31.720
I won't drink it!

29:43.600 --> 29:44.640
Ling,

29:46.600 --> 29:48.520
I'm truly doing this for your sake.

29:51.240 --> 29:54.040
Falling in love with a human
is harmful, not beneficial.

29:54.120 --> 29:57.160
The human heart is the most complex
and ever-changing thing.

29:58.080 --> 30:01.160
Today, they might treat you
with soft words,

30:01.920 --> 30:04.360
but tomorrow, they could turn their backs,

30:05.000 --> 30:07.720
even abandon you like a worn-out shoe

30:09.680 --> 30:11.600
and kill you.

30:15.440 --> 30:17.400
I truly don't want

30:17.480 --> 30:21.280
such a thing to happen to you.

30:23.320 --> 30:25.760
Sang Qi, have you ever loved someone?

30:29.720 --> 30:31.080
She hurt you, right?

30:34.120 --> 30:36.840
Twenty years ago, you lost an arm.

30:37.520 --> 30:38.960
Was it because of her?

30:39.040 --> 30:40.080
Silence!

30:43.800 --> 30:45.160
But Sang Qi,

30:46.240 --> 30:48.800
you've been betrayed, you've been hurt,

30:50.000 --> 30:52.360
yet you still refuse
to take the Disillusion Water.

30:53.520 --> 30:54.720
Why?

30:56.240 --> 30:59.400
Because you don't want to forget
the warmth she gave you,

31:00.480 --> 31:02.120
even if it might have been fake.

31:04.000 --> 31:05.280
Neither would I!

31:23.320 --> 31:25.000
Once it's taken,

31:26.040 --> 31:27.600
there's no turning back.

31:29.120 --> 31:30.880
You and Xie Xuechen

31:31.760 --> 31:34.000
are destined to become enemies.

31:39.600 --> 31:42.840
TEMPLE OF DIVINE EXECUTION

31:54.920 --> 31:56.440
Mister!

32:09.200 --> 32:10.440
Mu Xuanling!

32:11.280 --> 32:12.520
Half a day isn't enough
to understand the human world.

32:12.600 --> 32:13.880
If there's ever a chance,

32:14.720 --> 32:16.720
I'll take you to see the real human world.

32:18.080 --> 32:20.080
Mu Xuanling, disciple
of Snow City, protects the array!

32:21.080 --> 32:22.320
This is Snow City,

32:22.920 --> 32:24.120
and this is my decision.

32:28.880 --> 32:32.960
Tonight, I feel as though I've seen
the real human world.

32:35.760 --> 32:37.120
Xie Xuechen…

32:49.960 --> 32:52.600
BRIGHT SNOWY PAVILION

33:09.640 --> 33:11.680
As long as you're by my side,

33:12.320 --> 33:15.440
the sun and moon still rise and fall,
and the universe still endures,

33:16.360 --> 33:18.080
we will always be together.

33:19.600 --> 33:20.560
Don't leave…

33:22.200 --> 33:23.040
Don't leave!

33:24.640 --> 33:25.800
Sir.

33:26.320 --> 33:27.760
Sir, you're awake.

33:31.640 --> 33:34.280
Where's Mu Xuanling? Where's Mu Xuanling?

33:37.200 --> 33:38.960
I brought you medicine,

33:40.000 --> 33:42.440
but unexpectedly,
I encountered Sang Qi attacking the city.

33:42.520 --> 33:46.480
When I arrived, the only thing left
by your side was this folding fan.

33:47.520 --> 33:48.720
As for Miss Mu,

33:49.800 --> 33:52.720
according to the Immortal Alliance,
she was taken away by Sang Qi.

33:53.480 --> 33:55.480
Even Mr. Xie couldn't stop him.

34:13.480 --> 34:15.920
Do you know what it feels like
to gain, only to lose again?

34:20.159 --> 34:22.880
So, she truly was the one in my dreams,

34:25.239 --> 34:27.480
and yet I couldn't protect her.

34:32.400 --> 34:35.239
To gain and lose again
is one of life's greatest regrets.

34:35.960 --> 34:39.120
I can understand the pain within.

34:40.120 --> 34:42.920
Since she and the one in your dreams
are the same,

34:43.440 --> 34:44.520
what do you plan to do?

34:47.880 --> 34:51.719
There were three times
I tried to protect her,

34:53.120 --> 34:54.840
but each time, I failed.

35:00.280 --> 35:02.160
The first time, when I was young,

35:04.040 --> 35:06.520
I wanted to take her away
from the Moonlight Heights.

35:07.560 --> 35:09.080
But I couldn't fulfill my wish.

35:10.200 --> 35:12.320
The second time,
during the Immortal Alliance trial,

35:14.160 --> 35:16.480
I prepared the Separation Array for her,

35:16.560 --> 35:18.400
hoping to help her escape.

35:19.720 --> 35:22.360
But in the end, it was never put to use.

35:26.560 --> 35:27.560
This time,

35:29.040 --> 35:30.560
when Sang Qi attacked,

35:33.320 --> 35:35.280
I thought I could finally protect her.

35:35.920 --> 35:37.400
But in the end,

35:39.000 --> 35:40.560
I failed completely.

35:42.480 --> 35:43.640
Tell me…

35:44.640 --> 35:46.560
If this is fate,

35:47.760 --> 35:51.960
then why is my bond with her so deep?

35:58.800 --> 36:00.760
She is both my old friend

36:03.160 --> 36:05.240
and the one in my dreams.

36:16.360 --> 36:17.480
In the depths of my heart,

36:20.560 --> 36:24.280
I feel it's my destiny to guard her,

36:26.160 --> 36:27.560
to protect her.

36:34.360 --> 36:35.640
What about Xie Xuechen?

36:37.320 --> 36:38.160
How is he?

36:38.760 --> 36:41.120
Gravely injured, he remains unconscious.

36:44.600 --> 36:48.360
SWIRLING SNOW PAVILION

36:58.320 --> 36:59.200
Senior.

36:59.280 --> 37:00.200
You're awake.

37:01.200 --> 37:03.520
Mr. Nan, thank you
for sacrificing the ancient herb

37:03.600 --> 37:05.040
to create medicine for Mr. Xie.

37:07.080 --> 37:08.840
How was she taken by Sang Qi?

37:15.760 --> 37:16.800
Sir,

37:16.880 --> 37:21.560
Mu Xuanling leaving with Sang Qi
means betraying Snow City.

37:21.640 --> 37:22.840
You must act decisively.

37:23.840 --> 37:24.680
Judge people

37:25.800 --> 37:27.280
by their heart.

37:28.680 --> 37:30.800
I know what kind of person Mu Xuanling is.

37:32.600 --> 37:33.920
She did not betray Snow City.

37:35.920 --> 37:37.560
She's just using her own way

37:38.840 --> 37:41.240
to give me a reason
to let go of her guilt-free

37:42.240 --> 37:43.840
so I can save the humans.

37:45.000 --> 37:46.000
However,

37:47.400 --> 37:49.720
I knowingly let her fall to Sang Qi.

37:51.800 --> 37:53.120
In the end, I owe her.

37:54.160 --> 37:56.000
-Senior.
-Sir.

37:56.080 --> 37:58.400
Elder, Yan Tong,

37:59.760 --> 38:00.920
go inform the other sects

38:02.120 --> 38:03.320
that I'm fine now.

38:04.640 --> 38:05.480
Go.

38:05.560 --> 38:06.600
Understood.

38:07.280 --> 38:08.600
Senior, don't forget
to drink the medicine.

38:30.960 --> 38:32.480
If you had given it your all,

38:34.200 --> 38:35.840
you could have stopped Sang Qi

38:37.040 --> 38:38.440
and kept her here, right?

38:49.360 --> 38:51.160
But you didn't do it.

38:52.840 --> 38:53.960
Xie Xuechen…

38:58.080 --> 38:59.120
do you regret it?

39:07.080 --> 39:08.520
I once asked Elder Cang,

39:09.640 --> 39:12.000
how should I weigh and how should I choose

39:13.080 --> 39:15.480
between the life of one person,
a hundred people,

39:15.560 --> 39:16.680
and ten thousand people…

39:17.600 --> 39:20.280
What my father worried about
was like a curse.

39:20.360 --> 39:22.720
I resisted it over and over,
kept questioning it.

39:23.560 --> 39:27.000
And yet today, it still happened.

39:28.080 --> 39:29.320
In the end,

39:31.720 --> 39:33.600
I still made that choice.

39:36.320 --> 39:39.880
Since meeting Mu Xuanling,

39:41.520 --> 39:43.000
it's been a story of debts.

39:47.640 --> 39:49.520
What you and I care about is different,

39:51.160 --> 39:52.880
yet the outcome is the same.

39:55.600 --> 39:59.280
You couldn't save her because of duty,

40:00.800 --> 40:02.480
while I couldn't save her

40:03.760 --> 40:05.200
because I lacked strength.

40:09.000 --> 40:11.360
In the end, the one who bears all the pain

40:13.400 --> 40:14.920
is her alone.

40:22.600 --> 40:24.240
Now she's in the Dark Abyss,

40:27.200 --> 40:28.640
and we both know

40:31.000 --> 40:32.400
what we must do.

40:49.120 --> 40:50.320
Sir,

40:52.280 --> 40:53.720
how is Mr. Xie?

40:55.520 --> 40:59.200
After taking the ancient herb
you brought, he's fine now.

41:08.160 --> 41:09.160
Feng Yao,

41:10.360 --> 41:11.600
would you die for me?

41:12.760 --> 41:13.600
I would.

41:14.320 --> 41:15.200
Then, do you love me?

41:17.200 --> 41:18.480
No.

41:22.000 --> 41:23.520
So, it's the same with her.

41:25.400 --> 41:27.240
When Sang Qi attacked,

41:27.880 --> 41:29.520
she risked her life to save me.

41:31.560 --> 41:32.680
But the one she saved

41:33.800 --> 41:35.920
was just an old friend.

41:36.720 --> 41:38.200
Nothing more.

41:39.080 --> 41:40.520
You should've known this all along.

41:43.000 --> 41:43.840
No.

41:44.840 --> 41:46.440
You've always known.

41:49.160 --> 41:50.120
Yes.

41:52.560 --> 41:54.200
I've always known.

41:56.680 --> 41:59.560
I was just clinging to that bit of time
we spent together,

42:00.680 --> 42:04.240
lost in a dream I've had for years.

42:08.240 --> 42:10.040
But she clearly loves him.

42:11.640 --> 42:13.440
Why would she turn against him

42:14.480 --> 42:16.280
and never see him again,

42:17.120 --> 42:18.480
just to fulfill his wishes?

42:22.920 --> 42:23.960
Feng Yao,

42:26.480 --> 42:28.120
what exactly is love?

42:30.040 --> 42:31.520
Sir, you're asking the wrong person.

42:32.600 --> 42:35.400
As for this question,
I probably understand even less than you.

42:46.760 --> 42:48.880
If I truly understood nothing at all,

42:50.080 --> 42:51.920
then maybe it'd be easier.
